11) ZIP code (do not include extension, or state)

Rules:
- Output exactly ELEVEN lines and nothing else.
- Do not put 1), 2), etc or any other header in your response. It should only be the requested response.
- The name will either come in two formats: "Last, First Middle" or "First Middle Last". Note that the presence or absence of a comma will determine the format.
- Do NOT include any labels, bullet points, or extra words.
- DO NOT give any information on the provider.
- If you cannot find enough information for a field (other than MRN, secondary adress, or Middle_Name), output the text 'could not find' for that specific line.

MRN RULES (EXTREMELY IMPORTANT):
